# Contact form email routing

Contact form submissions are emailed to **usama@jaguarpvt.com**.

## Required

```env
RESEND_API_KEY=re_xxxxxxxx
```

Sign up at [resend.com](https://resend.com), verify the `jaguarpvt.com` domain, and create an API key.

## Optional

```env
# Defaults to usama@jaguarpvt.com
CONTACT_FORM_TO=usama@jaguarpvt.com

# Must use a verified sender on your Resend domain
CONTACT_FORM_FROM=Jaguar Website <notifications@jaguarpvt.com>

# Optional CRM webhook (still forwarded after email is sent)
CRM_WEBHOOK_URL=https://example.com/webhook

# Career applications (defaults to CONTACT_FORM_TO)
CAREERS_APPLY_TO=usama@jaguarpvt.com
```

## Notes

- Replies to notification emails go to the submitter (`replyTo` is set to their email).
- If `RESEND_API_KEY` is missing, the form returns an error instead of silently logging submissions.
